Modifications include supervised Mac/rule-oriented adaptation, strict full-input
4096/1024 budgets, independently fitted question-type temperatures, and a
portable local-inference loader. The inherited architecture and all heads are
retained. JEV is comparison/category context only; no JEV weights are included.
